            "description": "# \u8ba1\u7b97\u5f00\u62d3\u7b49\u7ea7\u5347\u7ea7\u6240\u9700\u65f6\u95f4\u8ba1\u7b97\n\u8ba1\u7b97\u5347\u7ea7\u6240\u9700\u65f6\u95f4\n\n\u5c1d\u8bd5\u53d1\u5e03PyPI\n\n# Todo\n- [ ] \u6bcf\u65e5\u4efb\u52a1\u7ecf\u9a8c\n- [ ] \u5927\u6708\u5361\u4f53\u529b\n\n\n# \u5b89\u88c5\n```\npip install srec\n```\n\n# \u793a\u4f8b\n```python\nimport srec\n\ncurrent_level = 47\ntarget_level = 70\ncurrent_exp = 2470\nnum_potions = 33\ncurrent_stamina = 39\n\nr = srec.Calculate(current_level, target_level, current_exp, num_potions, current_stamina)\n\nprint(r.designated_time)\n```\n\n# \u5404\u5f00\u62d3\u7b49\u7ea7\u6240\u9700\u7ecf\u9a8c\u8868\n| \u5f00\u62d3\u7b49\u7ea7 | \u5230\u4e0b\u4e00\u7ea7\u6240\u9700\u91cc\u7a0b | \u91cc\u7a0b\u5dee\u503c | \u7d2f\u8ba1\u91cc\u7a0b |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 450 | N/A | 0 |\n| 2 | 500 | 50 | 450 |\n| 3 | 550 | 50 | 950 |\n| 4 | 610 | 60 | 1500 |\n| 5 | 670 | 60 | 2110 |\n| 6 | 720 | 50 | 2780 |\n| 7 | 780 | 60 | 3500 |\n| 8 | 840 | 60 | 4280 |\n| 9 | 900 | 60 | 5120 |\n| 10 | 960 | 60 | 6020 |\n| 11 | 1020 | 60 | 6980 |\n| 12 | 1070 | 50 | 8000 |\n| 13 | 1130 | 60 | 9070 |\n| 14 | 1190 | 60 | 10200 |\n| 15 | 1250 | 60 | 11390 |\n| 16 | 1310 | 60 | 12640 |\n| 17 | 1370 | 60 | 13950 |\n| 18 | 1430 | 60 | 15320 |\n| 19 | 1500 | 70 | 16750 |\n| 20 | 1600 | 100 | 18250 |\n| 21 | 1710 | 110 | 19850 |\n| 22 | 1830 | 120 | 21560 |\n| 23 | 1950 | 120 | 23390 |\n| 24 | 2080 | 130 | 25340 |\n| 25 | 2210 | 130 | 27420 |\n| 26 | 2350 | 140 | 29630 |\n| 27 | 2480 | 130 | 31980 |\n| 28 | 2620 | 140 | 34460 |\n| 29 | 2750 | 130 | 37080 |\n| 30 | 2850 | 100 | 39830 |\n| 31 | 2960 | 110 | 42680 |\n| 32 | 3080 | 120 | 45640 |\n| 33 | 3200 | 120 | 48720 |\n| 34 | 3330 | 130 | 51920 |\n| 35 | 3460 | 130 | 55250 |\n| 36 | 3600 | 140 | 58710 |\n| 37 | 3730 | 130 | 62310 |\n| 38 | 3870 | 140 | 66040 |\n| 39 | 4000 | 130 | 69910 |\n| 40 | 4140 | 140 | 73910 |\n| 41 | 4280 | 140 | 78050 |\n| 42 | 4430 | 150 | 82330 |\n|